<!-- var(subject)="Invitation | ID Unlocked workshops — 24–25 November 2026, Angers" -->
<!-- var(summary)="ID Campus Unlocked workshops" -->


Dear APTITUDE partners and MoU members,

I am pleased to share an invitation from **ID Campus and La French Tech Angers** to **ID Unlocked**, taking place on **24–25 November 2026 at ID Campus in Angers, France**.

These two days will bring together practitioners, decision-makers and technology providers for practical workshops on the deployment and adoption of the European Digital Identity Wallet, covering four thematic tracks:

- **Banking & KYC:** integrating the wallet into banking services and customer identification journeys.
- **Trust & sensitive data:** building trusted services and managing sensitive information.
- **Relying parties:** addressing registration requirements and technical integration.
- **Use cases & adoption:** developing valuable services and encouraging uptake.

I will be attending and was pleased to contribute to the programme. I look forward to seeing many of you in Angers and building on our exchanges within APTITUDE and the MoU community.

**[<!-- link-model=button2 --> Register for ID Unlocked](https://luma.com/nq9ul8xh)**

Capacity is limited, and **registration is only valid once confirmed by the organisers**. For any questions, please contact [contact@idcampus.eu](mailto:contact@idcampus.eu).

You can find the full programme below:

![agenda <!-- cid=True --><!-- width=80% -->](<2026-10-20 - ID Campus unlocked - Agenda (Moyen).png>)

Please feel free to share this invitation with relevant colleagues within your organisations.

<br/>Best regards,

